-- gobgp-k1k2-send1-opens1.expected --
PeerAddress    RouterID       PeerASN   SessionState   KeepAlive   HoldTime   GracefulRestartTime   Opens   TCPAOKeys
10.99.11.102   10.99.11.102   65001     ESTABLISHED    3           9          0                     1       1/1(current,rnext) 2/2
-- gobgp-k1k2-send2-opens1.expected --
